  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 21 − 4 ÷ 371 + 111 × 3 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **+**\n **-**\n **×**\n **÷**\n \n \n\n **-**\n **×**\n **÷**\n **+**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 21 × 4 + 371 − 111 ÷ 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**21 × 4**__ + 371 − __**111 ÷ 3**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**84**__ + 371 − __**37**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**84 + 371**__ − 37 = ?\n\n⇒ __**455 − 37**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**418**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
